        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Lung rianra mei khang nga.",
            "Ai kapma kalang bampui ram me,",
            "Tabui nung manni cho ?",
            "Ai nkhuan ngam mak ge,",
            "Tabui nungh ruina man nina cho?",
            "Kanloumei gaipui ram khou bam khang .",
            "",
            "He! Tingsaeng gaipui ram khou ,",
            "Ai bam ni e, ai bam ni e, gaichui pui ram khou",
            "Nthan mei guai bam pui ram khou,",
            "Tingkao laoziu na lev bam cham ni.",
            "",
            "2. Kandih ryanra pui ram,",
            "Seitan rih tanna bampui ram khou,",
            "Lung bam khang kabam mak;",
            "Achun sina mikdui luang na",
            "Ai ningpui ram gaimei khou,",
            "He! Bumaeng thanmei le zailou o.",
            "",
            "3. Neihlaa mei zianmei nun ,",
            "Tingsang gaipui ram guang tang ngam the,",
            "Halleluijah Amen;",
            "Tingkao gaipui ram khou tei bam khang.",
            "Tingkao laoziu na le bam cham khang.",
            "",
            "4. Kandih khou rianra na,",
            "Kaapmei mikdui thutphui than lou the;",
            "Tingkao lauziu nah rui,",
            "Kagan guangtang mak khou",
            "Poubaomei ta nkhuan ngam makge,",
            "Theina ringthao datpui ram gaimei."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
